{"seq":3,"slug":"loading-exception-quality-governance","title":"装载异常处理与装载质量治理：短装超重、计划偏差与审计闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/wms-integration-loading-rate-operations/loading-exception-quality-governance","wordCount":2731,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"装载异常处理与装载质量治理-短装超重-计划偏差与审计闭环\">装载异常处理与装载质量治理：短装超重、计划偏差与审计闭环</h1><p>装载方案的&quot;最优解&quot;只在系统里成立，到现场就会撞上现实：卖家临时撤单导致整柜空出一个位、某箱货实际称重比主数据重 37 kg、报关资料没到齐只能先装一部分、司机在闸口地磅上被拦下来因为单轴超了。这些不是装箱算法的问题，而是<strong>装载异常</strong>——方案与执行之间必然出现的偏差。装箱率再高，如果异常发生时没有判定规则、没有处置路径、没有复盘闭环，运营指标照样会崩。本文处理异常本身：如何分类、如何判定、如何处置，以及如何把每一次异常变成一个可审计、可回溯、能反过来收紧规则的事件。上一章 <a href=\"../weight-stability-stowage-mixed-cargo/container-weight-balance-vgm\">集装箱重量配平：重心高度、偏载轴重与 VGM 申报合规</a> 解决了&quot;重量算得准&quot;，本章解决&quot;算得准之后现场出岔子怎么办&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-装载异常的四种形态\">核心概念：装载异常的四种形态</h2><p>装载异常按<strong>偏差指向</strong>分四类，它们的处置逻辑完全不同，混为一谈就会用错工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>观察点</th>\n<th>主要后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>短装（short shipment）</strong></td>\n<td>实装件数/体积少于计划</td>\n<td>装箱单 vs 装柜清单</td>\n<td>订单履约缺口、客户索赔、运费摊薄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>超装（over shipment）</strong></td>\n<td>实装超出计划且未被预报</td>\n<td>装柜清单 vs 订舱</td>\n<td>报关不符、卸货港退运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>超重（overweight）</strong></td>\n<td>实测总重或轴荷超限值</td>\n<td>地磅 / VGM 复核</td>\n<td>闸口拦截、重排、滞港费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>计划偏差（plan deviation）</strong></td>\n<td>实际装载率显著低于方案值</td>\n<td>系统预测 vs 实装</td>\n<td>亏舱、需临时拼柜、成本上升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四类里只有<strong>超重是硬约束</strong>——它由法规和物理决定，没有商量余地；另外三类是<strong>经济约束</strong>，允许在成本可控时容忍。这个区别决定了异常处理的优先级：超重必须先解决才能放行，短装则可以先放行再走商务流程。相邻的 <a href=\"../loading-problem-packaging-data-model/stackability-physical-attribute-modeling\">可堆叠性与物理属性建模</a> 定义了判定所需的物理字段，本章直接消费这些字段做异常识别。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;装柜执行&lt;br/&gt;扫描 + 称重&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;实测总重是否超限?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;超重异常&lt;br/&gt;禁止放行 · 重排&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{&quot;实装件数 = 计划?&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E{&quot;差额是否已预报?&quot;}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[&quot;正常调整&lt;br/&gt;记录偏差&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[&quot;短装/超装异常&lt;br/&gt;生成异常工单&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| H{&quot;装载率偏差 &gt; 阈值?&quot;}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[&quot;计划偏差&lt;br/&gt;归因 + 复盘&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[&quot;放行 · 归档正常&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"装柜执行&lt;br/&gt;扫描 + 称重\"] --&gt; B{\"实测总重是否超限?\"}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[\"超重异常&lt;br/&gt;禁止放行 · 重排\"]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{\"实装件数 = 计划?\"}\n  D --&gt;|否| E{\"差额是否已预报?\"}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[\"正常调整&lt;br/&gt;记录偏差\"]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[\"短装/超装异常&lt;br/&gt;生成异常工单\"]\n  D --&gt;|是| H{\"装载率偏差 &gt; 阈值?\"}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[\"计划偏差&lt;br/&gt;归因 + 复盘\"]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[\"放行 · 归档正常\"]</pre><h2 id=\"短装与超装的判定与处置\">短装与超装的判定与处置</h2><p>短装最容易被&quot;静默处理&quot;——现场把少装的货挪到下一柜，单据上却写&quot;已装&quot;，结果客户在目的港拆柜时才发现缺口。要堵住这个洞，判定必须<strong>基于扫描事实而非人工确认</strong>：每个 SSCC（Serial Shipping Container Code，GS1 定义的 18 位物流单元编码）在装柜时被扫描一次，实装集合与计划集合做差集运算，差额即短装集合。GS1 的 EDI 标准中，DESADV（发货通知，EDIFACT 报文 D96A 中的 DESADV 或 X12 的 856）承载这个计划集合，装柜结果回写后与订舱数据比对即可自动判定短装与超装。</p>\n<p>短装率的定义是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>short</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>plan</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>loaded</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>plan</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{\\text{short}} = \\frac{\\sum_{i \\in \\mathcal{P}} q_i^{\\text{plan}} - \\sum_{i \\in \\mathcal{P}} q_i^{\\text{loaded}}}{\\sum_{i \\in \\mathcal{P}} q_i^{\\text{plan}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">short</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8682em;vertical-align:-1.1841em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6841em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.143em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">plan</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">plan</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loaded</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1841em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为计划装柜的品项集合。运营上要设一个<strong>免处置阈值</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>short</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{\\text{short}} \\le 0.1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">short</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1%</span></span></span></span></span>（示例阈值，按业务标定）且差额为单件、低价值时，允许直接放行走事后补单；超过阈值则强制生成异常工单，在放行前由调度确认。这条规则的价值在于把&quot;现场拍脑袋&quot;变成&quot;阈值判定&quot;——阈值本身可审计、可调优，而人的判断不可审计。</p>\n<p>超装的危害常被低估。多装一件看似&quot;多赚了运费&quot;，但如果它没进报关单，在目的港就是<strong>报关不符</strong>，轻则补税、重则扣货。因此超装必须与短装对称处理：一旦实装集合的差集为正（多装），系统应在放行前触发报关资料更新，而不是等船开走。这里的工程要求是<strong>装柜动作与单证状态强耦合</strong>——装柜未完成对应单证更新的柜，不放行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超重-从地磅读数到重排决策\">超重：从地磅读数到重排决策</h2><p>超重异常的处理链条最长，因为它同时牵涉物理测量、法规限值和作业重排。判定的第一层是<strong>总重</strong>：实测毛重与 VGM 申报值的偏差超过 IMO 指引的 ±5% 容差（来源：IMO MSC.1/Circ.1475《关于 SOLAS 第 VI/2 条核验总重要求的实施指南》），即视为申报不实，需在装船前修正——SOLAS VI/2 修正案自 2016-07-01 生效，明确 VGM 责任在托运人。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>轴荷</strong>，它比总重更容易在闸口被拦。总重合规不代表轴荷合规：货物在箱内纵向偏心会让载荷经底盘车杠杆放大到某一根轴上。公路限值因司法辖区而异，工程上必须按<strong>目的地</strong>而非按发货地建模：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>辖区</th>\n<th>单车总重上限</th>\n<th>关键轴荷限值</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>80,000 lb（约 36.3 t）</td>\n<td>单轴 20,000 lb、双联轴 34,000 lb</td>\n<td>FHWA 联邦桥梁公式（Bridge Formula Weights）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>40 t（联运 44 t）</td>\n<td>驱动轴 11.5 t</td>\n<td>Council Directive 96/53/EC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>六轴 49 t</td>\n<td>按 GB1589-2016 轴荷表</td>\n<td>GB 1589-2016《汽车、挂车及汽车列车外廓尺寸、轴荷及质量限值》</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>重排决策要算清代价再动手：把一个 800 kg 的货件从车头移到车尾，可能同时改变轴荷、重心高度和绑扎点。系统应按&quot;改动最小、收益最大&quot;排序候选方案——优先移动<strong>最重的可移动件</strong>，因为轴荷对质量与力臂的乘积最敏感：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>axle</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>wb</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta F_{\\text{axle}} = \\frac{m_i \\cdot \\Delta x_i}{L_{\\text{wb}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">axle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该件沿箱长的位移，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>wb</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{wb}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为轴距。这个线性关系说明：与其挪动十件轻货，不如挪动一件重货。重排完成后必须重新称重并记录，因为<strong>重排本身可能引入新的偏心</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计划偏差-装载率与达成率的度量\">计划偏差：装载率与达成率的度量</h2><p>计划偏差衡量的是&quot;系统预测的装载率&quot;与&quot;实装的装载率&quot;之间的落差，它是<strong>算法的体检指标</strong>。体积装载率与重量装载率必须分开看：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>箱</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_v = \\frac{\\sum_i v_i}{V_{\\text{箱}}}, \\qquad \\eta_w = \\frac{\\sum_i w_i}{W_{\\max}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2757em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">箱</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2757em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两者背离时暴露的是结构性问题——缺重货会导致 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 先到顶而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍低（&quot;轻抛货&quot;），缺泡货则相反。计划达成率把预测拉进对比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>达成率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>η</mi><mi>v</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msubsup><msubsup><mi>η</mi><mi>v</mi><mtext>planned</mtext></msubsup></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{达成率} = \\frac{\\eta_v^{\\text{actual}}}{\\eta_v^{\\text{planned}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">达成率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5776em;vertical-align:-1.0515em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.143em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5834em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">planned</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1166em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0515em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当达成率长期低于一个控制下限（例如用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x} - 3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制图确定，等价于要求过程能力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk} \\ge 1.33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.33</span></span></span></span></span>），说明算法的输入假设失真，而不是现场执行差。常见的输入失真源有三：包装主数据陈旧（改箱未回传）、可堆叠性判断过乐观、约束集遗漏（如危险品隔离要求）。归因时按这三个方向逐项排除，而不是直接调低预测值——<strong>调低预测是掩盖问题，不是解决问题</strong>。装载率指标本身的定义与看板设计，见同章的 WMS 集成与装载率度量主线，本文只聚焦其作为异常判据的用法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;实装达成率下降&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;拆分偏差来源&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;几何: 体积/重量背离&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;数据: 主数据陈旧&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;约束: 遗漏隔离/承压规则&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;检查货型结构变化&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;追溯包装变更工单&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;补全约束集后重跑&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; I[&quot;收紧规则 / 更新基线&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[\"实装达成率下降\"] --&gt; B[\"拆分偏差来源\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"几何: 体积/重量背离\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"数据: 主数据陈旧\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"约束: 遗漏隔离/承压规则\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"检查货型结构变化\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"追溯包装变更工单\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"补全约束集后重跑\"]\n  F --&gt; I[\"收紧规则 / 更新基线\"]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"审计闭环-从异常工单到规则演进\">审计闭环：从异常工单到规则演进</h2><p>异常的价值不在&quot;这次处理掉了&quot;，而在&quot;下次不再发生&quot;。这就需要一个<strong>闭合的治理回路</strong>：异常工单 → 根因定位 → 纠正措施 → 验证有效性 → 规则固化。这个结构与国际质量管理标准的思路一致——ISO 9001:2015 第 10.2 条要求对不符合项采取纠正措施并<strong>评审其有效性</strong>，关键在&quot;评审有效性&quot;这一步，它把一次性救火和系统性改进区分开。</p>\n<p>工程上把它落成三张表加一条流水：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>异常工单表</strong>：记录异常类型、发生时间、关联柜号、处置动作、耗时、成本。</li>\n<li><strong>根因分类表</strong>：把每次异常归到一个受控的根因码（主数据错误、约束遗漏、现场操作、上游变动），禁止自由文本——自由文本无法聚合，无法聚合就无法发现模式。</li>\n<li><strong>措施与验证表</strong>：每条措施绑定一个验证条件和一个验证日期，到期未验证的措施不计入关闭。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>闭环节奏由<strong>复发率</strong>驱动。定义某根因码的复发率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>recur</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>该根因码在措施生效后 90 天内再次发生次数</mtext><mrow><mtext>措施生效前的月均发生次数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{recur}} = \\frac{\\text{该根因码在措施生效后 90 天内再次发生次数}}{\\text{措施生效前的月均发生次数} \\times 3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">措施生效前的月均发生次数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该根因码在措施生效后</span><span class=\"mord\"> 90 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天内再次发生次数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>recur</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{recur}} \\ge 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时，说明上一次措施无效，应升级处理层级（而不是重复同一条措施）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>recur</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{recur}} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 且样本量足够时，才可关闭。这套逻辑还回答了治理的一个实际问题：<strong>规则该不该收紧</strong>。每次异常都是规则的测试用例，如果某类异常反复出现于同一约束的缺失，正确的动作是补进规则并版本化，而不是靠人记住&quot;上次就是这么出的&quot;。</p>\n<p>审计留痕要满足<strong>可回溯</strong>要求：任何一个柜的最终装载状态，都应能从工单链反推出&quot;当时依据的是哪一版规则、哪一份主数据、哪一次人工干预&quot;。这既是内部治理的需要，也是面对客户索赔或海关质疑时的证据基础。审计日志本身属于运营敏感数据，其留存范围与访问权限应在系统设计阶段就限定，而非事后补救。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>装载异常分四类：短装、超装是<strong>经济约束</strong>，超重是<strong>硬约束</strong>，计划偏差是<strong>算法体检指标</strong>——处置优先级由约束性质决定。</li>\n<li>判定必须基于<strong>扫描事实</strong>（SSCC 差集、地磅读数），而非人工确认；免处置阈值要显式标定并纳入审计。</li>\n<li>超重处置要分总重与轴荷两层，轴荷限值按<strong>目的地辖区</strong>建模，重排优先移动最重件。</li>\n<li>计划偏差的归因方向是输入数据、约束集、货型结构，而不是调低预测值。</li>\n<li>治理闭环 = 工单 + 受控根因码 + 可验证措施，由<strong>复发率</strong>驱动升级与关闭，最终把异常固化为规则版本。</li>\n<li>自包含边界：本文只处理&quot;偏差发生之后&quot;，偏差发生之前的方案生成与配平分别见 <a href=\"../bin-packing-heuristic-solver/cartonization-carton-selection\">装箱启发式与求解</a> 与 <a href=\"../weight-stability-stowage-mixed-cargo/container-weight-balance-vgm\">重量配平与 VGM</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>来源</strong>：IMO SOLAS VI/2 修正案（2016-07-01 生效）；IMO MSC.1/Circ.1475；IMO/ILO/UNECE CTU Code（MSC.1/Circ.1497, 2014）；GS1 General Specifications 与 EDIFACT DESADV / X12 856；FHWA Bridge Formula Weights；Council Directive 96/53/EC；GB 1589-2016；ISO 9001:2015 第 10.2 条。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"装载异常处理与装载质量治理：短装超重、计划偏差与审计闭环","id":"装载异常处理与装载质量治理-短装超重-计划偏差与审计闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：装载异常的四种形态","id":"核心概念-装载异常的四种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"短装与超装的判定与处置","id":"短装与超装的判定与处置"},{"level":2,"text":"超重：从地磅读数到重排决策","id":"超重-从地磅读数到重排决策"},{"level":2,"text":"计划偏差：装载率与达成率的度量","id":"计划偏差-装载率与达成率的度量"},{"level":2,"text":"审计闭环：从异常工单到规则演进","id":"审计闭环-从异常工单到规则演进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"装载率度量体系：体积重量利用率、CBM 口径与偏差归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/wms-integration-loading-rate-operations/loading-rate-metrics-attribution"},"next":null}